  "title": "Red onion pickle",
  "slug": "red-onion-pickle",
  "summary": "A Norwegian-style pickled red onion condiment made with cider vinegar, sugar, and bay leaves. The onions are brined in salt before being submerged in a warm vinegar syrup.",
